# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# ARKLOG - AI Progress Reporter
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Application ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
APP_ENV=development
DEBUG=false
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
LOG_FORMAT=json

# ── API Server ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
API_HOST=0.0.0.0
API_PORT=8000

# ── CORS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# In production, replace * with your actual frontend origin(s)
# CORS_ORIGINS=["https://your-dashboard.com"]
CORS_ORIGINS=["*"]

# ── GitHub ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required in production. Generate with:
#   python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"
GITHUB_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_webhook_secret_here

# ── AI Provider (OpenRouter + Gemini) ────────────────────────────
# Get your key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# Browse models at: https://openrouter.ai/models
AI_API_KEY=your_openrouter_api_key_here
AI_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
AI_MODEL=google/gemini-2.5-flash
AI_MAX_TOKENS=2000
AI_TEMPERATURE=0.3

# ── ClickUp ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CLICKUP_API_TOKEN=your_clickup_token_here
CLICKUP_TEAM_ID=your_team_id_here

# ── Database ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DATABASE_URL=sqlite+aiosqlite:///./data/arklog.db

# ── Projects ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PROJECTS_CONFIG_PATH=projects.yaml

# ── Scheduler ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set to false on replica containers to prevent duplicate scheduled reports.
# When using a shared database (PostgreSQL), the SQLAlchemy job store already
# coordinates across instances — SCHEDULER_ENABLED=false is an extra safety valve.
SCHEDULER_ENABLED=true

# ── Webhook ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Maximum commits processed per webhook event (prevents AI context overflow)
MAX_COMMITS_PER_WEBHOOK=50
